<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Your OTP Code</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f0f4f8;
        color: #333;
        padding: 40px 20px;
      }
      .wrapper {
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff 0%, #0056cc 100%);
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        padding: 36px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header-icon {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        font-size: 26px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      }
      .header p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }
      .body {
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-left: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-right: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #1a202c;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .body p {
        font-size: 14.5px;
        color: #4a5568;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }
      .otp-box {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 32px 0;
      }
      .otp-label {
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        color: #a0aec0;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .otp-code {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 40px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 10px;
        color: #007bff;
        background: #f0f7ff;
        border: 2px dashed #b3d4ff;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 18px 32px;
        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      }
      .timer {
        margin-top: 14px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #e53e3e;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .timer span {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #fff5f5;
        border: 1px solid #fed7d7;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 3px 10px;
      }
      .divider {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }
      .warning-box {
        background: #fff8e1;
        border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
      }
      .warning-box p {
        color: #92400e;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f7f9fc;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-top: none;
        border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
        padding: 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .footer p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #a0aec0;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }
      .footer .brand {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #718096;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="header-icon">&#128272;</div>
        <h1>Verification Code</h1>
        <p>Use the code below to complete your verification</p>
      </div>

      <div class="body">
        <p class="greeting">Hello, <%= name %></p>
        <p>
          Please use the one-time verification code below to proceed. Do not
          share this code with anyone.
        </p>

        <div class="otp-box">
          <p class="otp-label">Your OTP Code</p>
          <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
          <div class="timer">
            <span>&#8987; Expires in 2 minutes</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <div class="warning-box">
          <p>
            &#9888;&nbsp; <strong>Never share this code</strong> with anyone,
            including Pixel Grade AI support staff. If you did not request
            this code, please ignore this email and ensure your account is
            secure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          This is an automated message — please do not reply to this email.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px;">
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
          <span class="brand">Pixel Grade AI</span>. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
